# Skill: Vercel Optimize

Purpose:
  Vercel project optimization skill. Provides scanners, gates, and
  recommendations for improving Vercel deployment performance, cost,
  and reliability.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @SKILL.md
   3  @references/recommendations.md
   4  @references/playbooks/README.md

Modes:
  APPLY    — apply optimization to current project
  REVIEW   — review project against optimization rules
  SCAN     — scan project for optimization opportunities

Rules:
  [VO1] All recommendations MUST be backed by Vercel documentation.
  [VO2] Gates MUST be non-blocking unless explicitly configured.
  [VO3] Scanner findings MUST include severity and effort estimate.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd
    SKILL.md

  Resolve:
    lib/scanners
    lib/gates
    references/playbooks

Navigation:
  VercelOptimize: @INDEX.sdd
  Skill: @SKILL.md
  Recommendations: @references/recommendations.md
  Playbooks: @references/playbooks/README.md

State: +